  "title": "Mary&#39;s Salted Caramel-Pecan Bars",
  "description": "Graham crackers are coated in buttery pecans and caramel and sprinkled with salt for an easy, sweet and savory treat for the holiday season.",
  "authors": [
    "Don"
  ],
